@startuml Contacts Flow - Clubinho NIB API
!theme plain
hide footbox
title Contacts — public submission and admin inbox

actor "Visitor / Admin" as Client
participant ContactController as Controller
participant "Create / Get / Update / Delete ContactService" as Service
database "MySQL\nContactsRepository" as Repository
participant NotificationService as Notify

alt Public submission
  Client -> Controller : POST /contact
  Controller -> Service : validated contact DTO
  Service -> Repository : persist unread message
  Service -> Notify : notify admins and send receipt safely
  Service --> Client : ContactResponseDto
else Admin inbox
  Client -> Controller : list, detail, unread count, mark or delete
  Controller -> Service : admin request + filters
  Service -> Repository : query or mutate message
  Repository --> Client : shared page, DTO, count or message
end

note over Service, Notify
  Message content and personal fields are never written to logs.
end note
@enduml
